Hi Pete,

Actually fscores() is the function you want for predicting the θ
parameters, but if you want them for the complete dataset you'll need
to pass the option full.scores = TRUE, which will return the original
data with the predictor scores appended to the rightmost column(s). To
further return only the matrix of scores, you can also pass the
scores.only = TRUE option. Cheers.

Phil

