Change the line

model_params$value = c(known_params$value,1,0) #overwrite values

to

model_params$value = c(known_params$value,0,1) #overwrite values

I think you accidental set the mean of the latent variable to 1 and
variance to 0, rather than visa-vera, which explains R's non-positive
definite message as well.

Phil

